  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Debt Contract Transparency Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The #PublicDebtIsPublic platform collects debt documentation across the public domain, and transforms it into a searchable, comparable, and decision-ready governance resource to improve debt management, enhance fiscal resilience, and achieve long-term debt sustainability. This approach to debt transparency promotes debtor and creditor accountability and raises the international standards for responsible sovereign lending and borrowing. The platform is designed as a unique public good to complement existing official and private debt governance tools and institutions. [UK funding at this early stage in the platform development is intended to be catalytic, helping crowd in other resources whilst allowing the UK to help shape the development of this resource and its interactions with different parts of the sovereign debt ecosystem.]</narrative>
  </description>
